{"id":27984,"slug":"the-long-day-closes","title":"The Long Day Closes","year":1992,"country":"United Kingdom","duration":85,"spine":694,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27984-the-long-day-closes","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/fc3986be048c75d41cef1dfaf83fc914/kUQl1CRr6yI3BlK2EmNhKqoQVzvfUB_large.jpg","description":"The Long Day Closes is the most gloriously cinematic expression of the unique sensibility of Terence Davies, widely celebrated as Britain’s greatest living filmmaker. Suffused with both enchantment and melancholy, this autobiographical film takes on the perspective of a quiet, lonely boy growing up in Liverpool in the 1950s. But rather than employ a straightforward narrative, Davies jumps in and out of time, swoops into fantasies and fears, summons memories and dreams. A singular filmic tapestry, The Long Day Closes is an evocative, movie- and music-besotted portrait of the artist as a young man.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Terence Davies","slug":"terence-davies"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Leigh McCormack","role":"Bud","slug":"leigh-mccormack"},{"actor":"Marjorie Yates","role":"Mother","slug":"marjorie-yates"},{"actor":"Anthony Watson","role":"Kevin","slug":"anthony-watson"},{"actor":"Nicholas Lamont","role":"John","slug":"nicholas-lamont"},{"actor":"Ayse Owens","role":"Helen","slug":"ayse-owens"},{"actor":"Tina Malone","role":"Edna","slug":"tina-malone"},{"actor":"Jimmy Wilde","role":"Curly","slug":"jimmy-wilde"},{"actor":"Robin Polley","role":"Mr. Nicholls","slug":"robin-polley"},{"actor":"Kirk McLaughlin","role":"Laborer/Christ","slug":"kirk-mclaughlin"},{"actor":"Brenda Peters","role":"Nurse","slug":"brenda-peters"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Terence Davies","slug":"terence-davies"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Terence Davies","slug":"terence-davies"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Olivia Stewart","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Ben Gibson","slug":null},{"role":"Execut